{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Preserve environment proxy routing**\n\nThe removed `build_opener()` installed Python's default `ProxyHandler`, while these direct connections never consult `HTTP_PROXY`, `HTTPS_PROXY`, or `NO_PROXY`. This breaks `HttpExporter`, `OTelExporter`, and `OpenSearchExporter` wherever outbound traffic must use a proxy. Preserve proxy discovery and bypass handling, including HTTPS `CONNECT`, while applying the deadline, and add HTTP/HTTPS proxy regression tests.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOPsIIsM7vpdRv","finding_digest":"5dee70e51aa88eaa00f436115306334d8936f4d42d25a73feafd7ce9b33b40e6","finding_id":"arf_v1_lxxhbzi2vchkuahugyivgbrtjw","finding_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::http_send::proxy-routing-preservation","identity_key":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/exporters/_common.py::http_send::proxy-routing-preservation","line":104,"observation_digest":"72f07642e484e54dd8eaa94fb8159026524557aa47ee423bf4fb442befff7ba7","observation_id":"aro_v1_olyhmqxeqtsu3whkvfh3qfmqez","path":"packages/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python-insight/src/aws_durable_execution_sdk_python_insight/exporters/_common.py","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_lxxhbzi2vchkuahugyivgbrtjw","published_at":"2026-09-15T22:05:02Z","review_id":"arr_v1_vzqvk7bxp55s6e4dweav2lirxm","reviewed_base_sha":"5a09149848101e44a4281c53c74dc9f1a98d1ffd","reviewed_head_sha":"868a2fc71b31c0ac53b47353c26ad14381cfac13","reviewer":"codex","start_line":96,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":729},"record_id":"art_v1_uxz37g55hhyizbrwtn2htldkxf","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-15T22:05:02Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-python","id":1052903600},"schema_version":1}
